---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import CtaStrip from '../components/CtaStrip.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About IBE | Engineering practice that builds its own tools"
  description="Integrated Building Engineering is a New Hampshire engineering practice that builds the software tools it uses on real coordinated projects."
>
  <Hero
    eyebrow="About IBE"
    headlineLead="Software and services from working "
    underlinedWord="engineers."
    headlineTail=""
    sub="Integrated Building Engineering is a New Hampshire engineering practice. We design coordinated HVAC, plumbing, and BIM deliverables — and we build the software we wished existed while doing it."
  />

  <section class="section rebrand-note-section">
    <div class="container">
      <aside class="rebrand-note">
        <p>
          IBE is the new name for T.R.W. Design, LLC — the same New Hampshire engineering
          practice and the same engineers, now with the software we build under one roof.
          Nothing changes for existing clients or engagements.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <article>
        <span class="eyebrow">Our approach</span>
        <h2>The tools come from the work.</h2>
        <p>
          Every piece of software we run started as something we built to make our own
          coordination faster and more reliable — automated extraction, Revit workflows,
          reality capture, custom design tools. Once a workflow proves itself on real projects,
          we roll it out gradually, starting with partner teams in private beta.
        </p>
        <p>
          That order matters. We don't ship workflows we don't use ourselves, and engineering
          judgment always stays with qualified professionals — the software removes repetitive
          manual work, not accountability.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span class="eyebrow">Who we serve</span>
        <h2>Pros first, builders welcome.</h2>
        <p>
          We work with engineering firms, contractors, developers, and BIM coordinators who need
          coordinated, constructable deliverables. We also build for remodelers, estimators, and
          designers who need permit-ready outputs without becoming full-time Revit operators.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container founder">
      <div class="founder__portrait" aria-hidden="true">
        {/* TODO(Tyler): drop a real portrait into public/images and reference it here. */}
      </div>
      <div class="founder__bio">
        <span class="eyebrow">Founder</span>
        <h2>Tyler Wilson</h2>
        <p>
          Tyler Wilson is the founder of IBE, building on years of mechanical and plumbing design
          and BIM coordination. His work centers
          on coordinated, field-ready documentation across every trade: HVAC, plumbing, sheet
          metal and ductwork, electrical, and fire protection, modeled clash-free in 2D and 3D
          Revit so crews keep moving on site.
        </p>
        <p>
          He started IBE to close the gap between how building systems are designed and how they
          actually get built — turning the repetitive parts of coordination into software so
          engineers can spend their time on judgment, not redraws.
        </p>
        <p>
          Tyler is an ASHRAE board member and serves on the executive board of the ACE Mentor
          Program of New Hampshire as treasurer, helping bring the next generation into the AEC
          industry.
        </p>
        {/* TODO(Tyler): add a portrait (public/images) and, once licensed, PE details. */}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaStrip
    taglineLead="Plan Well. "
    taglineWord="Build Well."
    taglineTail=""
    primaryHref="mailto:info@ibe.engineering?subject=Project%20inquiry"
    primaryLabel="Talk to our engineers"
    secondaryHref="/services"
    secondaryLabel="See services"
  />
</Base>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--s-10);
  }

  .about-grid article {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-4);
    align-content: start;
  }

  .about-grid h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
  }

  .about-grid p {
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
  }

  .founder {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
    gap: var(--s-10);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .founder__portrait {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-rule);
    background: var(--color-surface-alt);
  }

  .founder__bio {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-4);
  }

  .founder__bio h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
  }

  .founder__bio p {
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
  }

  .rebrand-note-section {
    padding-block: 0;
  }

  .rebrand-note {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--color-surface-alt);
    padding: var(--s-5) var(--s-6);
  }

  .rebrand-note p {
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    max-width: 70ch;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about-grid,
    .founder {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .founder__portrait {
      max-width: 280px;
    }
  }
</style>
